WEBVTT

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
This is the story of a visit to
a land that knows no winter.

00:00:19.001 --> 00:00:23.000
The land where the sun rains.

00:00:28.001 --> 00:00:33.000
Greater

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.001
Miami, Dade County.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:52.001
This is Dade County, Florida,
with over half a million residents, an area

00:00:52.001 --> 00:00:58.000
stretching from horizon to horizon,
including Greater Miami, Miami Beach, and

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:01.000
extending as far south as the Florida Keys.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Since the early days of Spanish explorers,
people have come in increasing numbers

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:13.001
to the southernmost American metropolis,
and today, Dade County is one of the

00:01:13.001 --> 00:01:16.001
nation's major transportation destinations.

00:01:25.001 --> 00:01:32.000
Every day, hundreds of families come
to Greater Miami. Many come by plane,

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.001
arriving at Miami's famous
international airport.

00:01:44.001 --> 00:01:51.000
Some come by streamlined train,
and thousands come by automobile.

00:01:59.001 --> 00:02:04.001
There's a lot to see in Dade County,
and there are a lot of ways to get around.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:09.000
But look, here's a family that's
going to be a little different.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:14.000
Mom, Dad, and little Lisa have
decided to see Greater Miami in a

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.000
most unusual way.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:28.000
So let's join them on a helicopter excursion
around the area, and see the sunny

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.001
land as it's never been seen before.

00:02:31.001 --> 00:02:35.000
All aboard, and stand by for a smooth takeoff.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:05.000
Greater Miami's mainland, and the islands
of Miami Beach and Key Biscayne, are

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:09.000
connected by five major causeways
across sparkling Biscayne Bay.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:13.001
Dade County is noted for these
convenient spans across the bay.

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:28.001
And here we go over the world's largest
and most unique concentration of hotels,

00:03:28.001 --> 00:03:30.001
motels, and apartment buildings.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:38.000
It's Greater Miami's front yard,
where there's a continuous round of

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:39.001
fun all year long.

00:03:40.001 --> 00:03:45.001
This is popular Miami Beach,
the playground of the Americas, where there's

00:03:45.001 --> 00:03:48.001
pleasure and excitement for
every size vacation budget.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:13.001
The crystal blue waters of Greater Miami
have lured our family to take time out

00:04:13.001 --> 00:04:17.001
for a refreshing swim at one of the
many ocean beaches in the county.

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:29.000
Yes, and there are hundreds of fresh
and saltwater pools, where swimming and

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:31.000
relaxing are possible every day in the year.

00:04:47.001 --> 00:04:52.001
We take to the air again to see
what water fun others are having.

00:04:57.000 --> 00:05:01.001
There's sailing, water skiing,

00:05:04.001 --> 00:05:07.001
even sightseeing from one of
the pleasure cruise boats.

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:13.000
And of course,
there's world famous Florida fishing.

00:05:13.001 --> 00:05:20.001
There are many ways to fish in Greater
Miami by charter boat, by party boat

00:05:20.001 --> 00:05:27.000
from the beaches, on a bridge or pier,

00:05:30.001 --> 00:05:34.000
and even on a quiet inland lake.

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:40.000
But whichever way you choose, the fishing
is the finest in the world, bar none.

00:05:42.001 --> 00:05:45.001
Our family is next taken by
Whirly Bird to the races.

00:05:47.001 --> 00:05:52.000
The finest thoroughbreds come to Greater
Miami to thrill visitors and to run for

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:57.000
the big stakes, offered at the area's
three beautiful, spacious race courses.

00:06:06.001 --> 00:06:12.000
Other parry mutual sports in Greater Miami
include the lightning fast dog races,

00:06:12.001 --> 00:06:17.001
where swift grey hounds pursue an
elusive cotton bunny and provide thrills

00:06:17.001 --> 00:06:19.001
aplenty for the eager spectators.

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:35.000
And speaking about thrills,
there's the breathtaking sport of High Lie, the

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:36.001
fastest game in the world.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:41.001
It takes years of practice and superb
physical condition to play this fascinating

00:06:41.001 --> 00:06:45.000
game with this kind of speed and agility.

00:06:45.001 --> 00:06:51.001
High Lie is another popular parry mutual
sport in this land where the sun rains.

00:06:56.000 --> 00:07:02.000
The real beginning of Greater

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:08.001
Miami's year of fun is the King Orange
Jamboree with the New Year's Eve parade, a

00:07:08.001 --> 00:07:10.001
spectacle of brilliant color.

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:17.001
And the New Year's Day football classic,
a game between two of the

00:07:17.001 --> 00:07:19.000
top teams in the country.

00:07:21.001 --> 00:07:27.001
There's something going on in
the Orange Bowl all year round.

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:41.000
Our visitors decide to inspect one of
the many golf courses in Greater Miami.

00:07:41.001 --> 00:07:47.001
This one is a public course,
open all the time and always in top condition.

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:53.001
Dad tries his skill on the carpet smooth
green while little Lisa holds the flag.

00:07:54.001 --> 00:07:56.000
Both do a perfect job.

00:07:58.001 --> 00:08:03.001
While our visitors have seen many of the
places of fun in the community, they

00:08:03.001 --> 00:08:06.001
took time off to peek into
how Greater Miamians live.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:11.001
Everywhere throughout Dade County,
there are modeled communities with places of

00:08:11.001 --> 00:08:17.000
worship and schools and homes ranging
from peaceful suburban bungalows to

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:18.001
magnificent mansions.

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:25.000
Famous shopping centers with wide streets
and plenty of parking space such as

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:29.000
Lincoln Road,
Miracle Mile and Flagler Street add to

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:30.001
the pleasure of Dade County living.

00:08:39.001 --> 00:08:45.001
Greater Miami is proud of its fast
growing University of Miami. The young

00:08:45.001 --> 00:08:50.001
university has an enrollment of over
10,000 and is a leading research center of

00:08:50.001 --> 00:08:54.000
the South,
attracting students from all over the world.

00:09:02.001 --> 00:09:09.000
On the shores of Biscayne Bay, we see
imposing Villa Viscaya, the Art Museum of

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:14.000
Dade County, a $14 million heritage of art,
treasures and culture.

00:09:14.001 --> 00:09:19.001
Greater Miami culture is also reflected
in the modern auditoriums of Dade County.

00:09:20.001 --> 00:09:25.000
Regular programs feature outstanding
attractions. Greater Miami is one of the

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:29.001
leading convention centers of the nation.
Conventions of any size can be

00:09:29.001 --> 00:09:31.001
readily accommodated.

00:09:35.001 --> 00:09:41.001
From the air, we see the breadbasket of
Greater Miami, South Dade County. This

00:09:41.001 --> 00:09:46.000
Redlands district is one of the most
fertile areas in the whole state of Florida

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:50.000
and provides residents with a
wide variety of fresh fruits and

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:52.000
vegetables all year.

00:09:52.001 --> 00:09:58.000
Bomb is attracted by the right mangoes,
a tropical delicacy grown in Dade County.

00:10:05.001 --> 00:10:10.001
Liking the looks of Greater Miami more
every minute, Dade looks into the

00:10:10.001 --> 00:10:16.001
industrial opportunities in Dade County
and he finds many. Light manufacturing is

00:10:16.001 --> 00:10:21.001
a major industry and an important
segment of the economy of this land of

00:10:21.001 --> 00:10:23.000
perpetual springtime.

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:30.000
Greater Miami made products are sold
throughout the world. Better business means

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:35.000
better living and Dade County's industrial
scene is humming with activity.

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:58.000
From industry to Indians, that's the
contrast of Greater Miami. These are Dade

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:01.001
County's first residents,
the famous and colorful Seminole

00:11:01.001 --> 00:11:03.001
Indians of the Florida Everglades.

00:11:03.001 --> 00:11:09.000
They entertain our family with their
fascinating souvenirs and thrill them with

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:12.000
the dangerous sport of alligator wrestling.

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:38.001
Later, Mom and little Lisa enjoy the
world-famous garden paradise, Fairchild

00:11:38.001 --> 00:11:42.000
Tropical Gardens,
a vivid display of the natural garden.

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:43.000
This is the beautiful beauty of Dade County.

00:11:47.001 --> 00:11:54.001
But all that is beautiful and exciting
is not limited to the daylight hours

00:11:54.001 --> 00:12:00.000
in Greater Miami. Nighttime also
promises a round of activity, theaters,

00:12:00.001 --> 00:12:05.001
nightclubs and moonlight cruises
await visitors any night of the year.

00:12:06.001 --> 00:12:12.001
And before our family sets out on its
nighttime excursion of fun, they have a

00:12:12.001 --> 00:12:17.001
memorable meal in a beautifully appointed
restaurant with a view that allows them

00:12:17.001 --> 00:12:21.000
to look out over the dream
that became a reality to them.

00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:30.000
You too can enjoy the same
fun of Greater Miami.

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:36.001
Find out more about this sunny land right
to the Greater Miami Development Board,

00:12:36.001 --> 00:12:43.000
Post Office Box 589, Miami, Florida.
We'll be looking for you soon in Greater

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:47.001
Miami, Dade County,
the land where the sun rains.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:32.000
Thank you.
